#: ../../source/recipes/gemma4.rst:92
msgid ""
"Gemma 4 supports MTP speculative decoding through separate **assistant "
"checkpoints** (``google/gemma-4-<size>-it-assistant``), which vLLM loads "
"as the draft model. The draft layers carry their own KV cache; LMCache "
"detects them from vLLM's ``speculative_config`` and stores/retrieves the "
"draft-layer KV together with the target model's -- no extra LMCache flags"
" are required."
msgstr ""

